# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""What each glossary term needs beyond its one line definition.

A definition alone makes a thin page, and a thin page is worse than no page.
Each entry adds why the term matters to someone running a small business, a
worked example with real numbers where the term is quantitative, and the tool
on this site that uses it.
"""

# key: (why it matters, worked example or None, related tool or None)
